WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.367 --> 00:00:02.902
-Welcome, everybody.
Welcome, welcome, welcome.

00:00:02.902 --> 00:00:04.270
Have fun.
Welcome to "The Tonight Show."

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:05.504
Thank you for tuning in.

00:00:05.504 --> 00:00:08.041
-[ Cheers and applause ]
-Thank you for being here.

00:00:08.041 --> 00:00:09.742
Today is the day everybody.

00:00:09.742 --> 00:00:13.246
The "Friends" reunion
is now available on HBO Max.

00:00:13.246 --> 00:00:15.548
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:15.548 --> 00:00:17.349
And just like every reunion,

00:00:17.349 --> 00:00:19.885
people were mainly excited to
see who gained the most weight.

00:00:19.885 --> 00:00:22.455
And it's Marcel, actually.
-Is it really?

00:00:22.455 --> 00:00:23.990
-You wouldn't
even recognize him.

00:00:23.990 --> 00:00:26.592
The thing is so huge, though,
HBO Max is already planning

00:00:26.592 --> 00:00:28.561
a "Friends Reunion:
The Reunion."

00:00:28.561 --> 00:00:29.962
-Yeah.
-Really?

00:00:29.962 --> 00:00:33.433
Each cast member was paid
$2.5 million for the special.

00:00:33.433 --> 00:00:34.634
[ Audience ohh's ]

00:00:34.634 --> 00:00:36.435
Meanwhile, when he heard,
Gunther was like,

00:00:36.435 --> 00:00:38.538
"You guys got paid?

00:00:38.538 --> 00:00:40.739
They told me
this was just for fun."

00:00:40.739 --> 00:00:42.241
$2.5 million is a lot.

00:00:42.241 --> 00:00:43.709
I mean, for that kind of money,

00:00:43.709 --> 00:00:46.312
you can almost subscribe
to HBO Max and Netflix.

00:00:46.312 --> 00:00:47.680
[ Laughter ]

00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:50.049
That's right. The "Friends"
reunion is a big success,

00:00:50.049 --> 00:00:51.184
and it looks like HBO Max

00:00:51.184 --> 00:00:52.718
has even more plans
for the franchise.

00:00:52.718 --> 00:00:54.253
Check this out.

00:00:54.253 --> 00:00:55.721
-From the people
who brought you "Friends,"

00:00:55.721 --> 00:00:58.824
coming soon to HBO Max,
it's "Young Gunther."

00:00:58.824 --> 00:01:01.827
The story of a little bald boy
who dreams of someday

00:01:01.827 --> 00:01:04.931
making cappuccinos
for hot 30-somethings.

00:01:04.931 --> 00:01:06.332
-I don't know
if that's gonna work.

00:01:06.332 --> 00:01:08.000
[ Applause ]

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:09.502
Some more entertainment news.

00:01:09.502 --> 00:01:14.407
Amazon just reached a deal to
buy MGM studios for $8 billion.

00:01:14.407 --> 00:01:16.575
Yeah, at this point,
the only thing Jeff Bezos

00:01:16.575 --> 00:01:18.311
doesn't own is hair.

00:01:18.311 --> 00:01:21.080
[ Laughter ]

00:01:21.080 --> 00:01:24.284
Yeah. Amazon owns
the "James Bond" franchise.

00:01:24.284 --> 00:01:25.484
The creators of "James Bond"

00:01:25.484 --> 00:01:27.219
said there won't be
any obvious changes

00:01:27.219 --> 00:01:29.055
except there's one scene
where Bond orders

00:01:29.055 --> 00:01:31.791
two martinis
and then drunk-shops on Amazon.

00:01:31.791 --> 00:01:34.227
-[ Laughter ]
-But check this out.

00:01:34.227 --> 00:01:36.996
I saw that CVS is now
offering prizes for people

00:01:36.996 --> 00:01:39.165 line:0%
who get vaccinated
in their pharmacies.

00:01:39.165 --> 00:01:41.200 line:0%
Some of the prizes
are pretty great,

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:42.468 line:0%
especially the grand prize --

00:01:42.468 --> 00:01:44.003
the key to the locked case

00:01:44.003 --> 00:01:46.072
where they keep all
the razors and deodorant.

00:01:46.072 --> 00:01:48.141
[ Laughter ]

00:01:48.141 --> 00:01:49.642
[ Applause ]

00:01:49.642 --> 00:01:51.477
Meanwhile, last night,
Ohio announced

00:01:51.477 --> 00:01:54.781
the first two winners
of its Vax-a-Million lottery.

00:01:54.781 --> 00:01:58.484
Yep, any vaccinated adult
was eligible to win $1 million.

00:01:58.484 --> 00:02:00.586
That's pretty crazy,
but Ohio isn't the only state

00:02:00.586 --> 00:02:02.955
offering incentives
to vaccinated residents.

00:02:02.955 --> 00:02:04.924
Check out what you could win
in other states.

00:02:04.924 --> 00:02:07.527
First up, if you get vaccinated
in Vermont,

00:02:07.527 --> 00:02:09.662 line:0%
they'll let you spoon
with either Ben or Jerry

00:02:09.662 --> 00:02:11.764 line:0%
for as long as you want.

00:02:11.764 --> 00:02:15.101 line:0%
Big spoon, little spoon.
Your choice.

00:02:15.101 --> 00:02:17.470 line:0%
Up next, if you're vaccinated
in South Dakota,

00:02:17.470 --> 00:02:20.305 line:0%
you're eligible to become
the fifth head on Mt. Rushmore.

00:02:20.305 --> 00:02:21.774 line:0%
-"Room for one more!"

00:02:21.774 --> 00:02:25.111 line:0%
-Ah. Next up, if you get
vaccinated in Florida,

00:02:25.111 --> 00:02:27.413 line:0%
you can get blackout drunk
and drive an ATV

00:02:27.413 --> 00:02:30.216 line:0%
through Walmart
without any consequences.

00:02:30.216 --> 00:02:32.952 line:0%
[ Applause ]

00:02:32.952 --> 00:02:35.054 line:0%
Actually, you can do that,
no matter what.

00:02:35.054 --> 00:02:36.656 line:0%
It's a right in Florida.

00:02:36.656 --> 00:02:38.624 line:0%
And, finally, if you get
vaccinated in Georgia,

00:02:38.624 --> 00:02:40.659 line:0%
they'll let you take a picture
with Jimmy Carter

00:02:40.659 --> 00:02:43.096 line:0%
so that you can look
like a giant.

00:02:43.096 --> 00:02:45.998
[ Laughter ]

00:02:45.998 --> 00:02:47.533
Well, this is very interesting.

00:02:47.533 --> 00:02:49.568
A new feature just became
available on Instagram

00:02:49.568 --> 00:02:52.838
and Facebook that allows users
to hide likes.

00:02:52.838 --> 00:02:54.407
No more likes?

00:02:54.407 --> 00:02:55.975
In response,
everyone canceled their brunch

00:02:55.975 --> 00:02:57.477
and gave away their babies.

00:02:57.477 --> 00:02:58.911
[ Laughter ]

00:02:58.911 --> 00:03:01.280
"I'm not in it for that.
I'm not in it for that."

00:03:01.280 --> 00:03:03.616
Listen to this.
I heard that Walmart is going --

00:03:03.616 --> 00:03:05.518
working with Gap to launch

00:03:05.518 --> 00:03:07.720
a new home-goods brand
called Gap Home.

00:03:07.720 --> 00:03:09.656
That's right.
Walmart home décor.

00:03:09.656 --> 00:03:11.356
It's the only place
you can get an Ottoman

00:03:11.356 --> 00:03:12.992
with a lower-back tattoo.

00:03:12.992 --> 00:03:15.528
[ Laughter ]

00:03:15.528 --> 00:03:17.964
I saw that a McDonald's
in Illinois came up with

00:03:17.964 --> 00:03:19.965
a creative way
to recruit new employees.

00:03:19.965 --> 00:03:22.167
Look at this --
the sign they put out there.

00:03:22.167 --> 00:03:24.270
It says,
"Now hiring. Free iPhone

00:03:24.270 --> 00:03:28.040
after six months' employment
and meet criteria."

00:03:28.040 --> 00:03:30.009
Owner's gonna be thrilled
with his new employees

00:03:30.009 --> 00:03:32.311
until the first day
of month seven.

00:03:32.311 --> 00:03:35.047
[ Laughter ]

00:03:35.047 --> 00:03:36.815
Some giant culinary news here.

00:03:36.815 --> 00:03:38.618
I saw that DiGiorno
is coming out with a new

00:03:38.618 --> 00:03:41.053
limited-edition
doughnut pizza mash-up

00:03:41.053 --> 00:03:43.723
called the DiGiornut.

00:03:43.723 --> 00:03:45.124
Here it is.

00:03:45.124 --> 00:03:46.959
[ Audience groans ]

00:03:46.959 --> 00:03:50.129
"It's not delivery.
It's disgusting."

00:03:50.129 --> 00:03:53.032
It's perfect if you thought you
hit rock bottom with Bagel Bites

00:03:53.032 --> 00:03:55.434
but still wanted to dig
a little deeper.

00:03:55.434 --> 00:03:57.369
And, finally,
a skydiver in California

00:03:57.369 --> 00:03:59.872
missed his landing zone
and wound up getting caught

00:03:59.872 --> 00:04:01.908
in some power lines.
Take a look at this.

00:04:01.908 --> 00:04:03.409
[ Audience ooh's ]

00:04:03.409 --> 00:04:05.011
The good news is his Apple Watch

00:04:05.011 --> 00:04:07.246
is charged for
the next seven years.

